Volt Labs, episode 6: "Lab Inspection" (2026). Original characters, story, pictures and music. Part of the Void Mart universe.

Pictures: drawn in code (canvas 2D) with the Volt Labs kit (channel/brand/lab.js, channel/brand/labkit.js), the movement helpers (channel/brand/travel.js) and the shared toon kit (channel/brand/toon.js, channel/brand/vmkit.js).
Fonts: Bungee (The Bungee Project Authors), Fredoka (The Fredoka Project Authors) and VT323 (Peter Hull), SIL Open Font License 1.1.
Voices: ElevenLabs text-to-speech, model eleven_v4.
  Dr. Vera Volt: "LAB Vera Volt" and Cleo: "LAB Cleo" (ElevenLabs Voice Design, made for this show). The city inspector: "Matilda" (ElevenLabs stock voice).
Sound effects: generated with ElevenLabs Sound Effects (prompts in sfx/prompts.json, some from earlier Volt Labs episodes). The room tone is generated in tools/mix.py.
Music: original score for the Volt Labs band (tools/band.py, cued in tools/score.py) played with CC0 samples from VSCO 2 Community Edition and VCSL.
